WEBVTT

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.080
Teppei!  Come and help me now!

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.650
Yeah, I'm coming.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.880
Ah, finished your routine?

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.860
I'm on my way to the shower.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.510
Let's do a round since it's been a while.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.600
Are you sure you're done with the preparations?

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:45.230
Of course!  If you want to succeed me you'd better come and help out!

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.210
What do you mean, succeed you?

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.020
I've got plenty of things I want to do, too!

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.130
You mean dirty things?

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.810
Well, I've got that in mind as well.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:57.630
What are you both up to!?

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.950
Teppei, I told you to help me!

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.060
Honey, what the hell are you doing with stuff that's for sale?!

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:06.370
Seriously, it's as if I've got <i>two</i> little kids in the house.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.470
Itadakimasu!

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.720
Last night at about 7pm, on a road in Shibuya ward,

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:25.420
forty-five year old Saeko, also from the same ward, was involved in a tragic traffic incident that occurred that night.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:24.290
There seem to be a lot of these lately.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.930
The only ones who get hit are the rich people.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:29.590
The incident was similar to last year's attempted murder case in the city, according to the police.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.310
It has nothing to do with us.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:37.030
Teppei, if you happened to become involved in such a thing, what would you do?

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.070
What do you mean?  The only ones who are targeted are rich.

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.730
I'm saying, "what if".

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.700
What if, eh...?

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:52.090
Well, I'd deal with it somehow.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.070
"Deal with it somehow", eh?

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.450
What would <i>you</i> do in that case?

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.630
Isn't it obvious?

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:03.630
Deal with it somehow.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.010
Jeez.  There really are two kids in this house.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.530
Oh, dammit!

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:12.340
You're late again?

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.020
You don't know that yet!

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.860
Teppei!  You're not allowed to use the motorbike!

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:22.100
Your teacher scolded me the last time!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.600
I'm just riding it to a place near the school!

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.130
Don't talk back to me!

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.160
I'm sorry!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.790
Sheesh.  Who does he take after anyway...?

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.130
His mom, right?

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.510
And what are you still doing with the stuff we're supposed to be selling!?

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:37.290
I'm sorry!

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:52.050
That was the very last time I saw Mom and Dad.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:45.770
Dad, Mom, during these two months, I've been wondering...

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.860
I think I will go to Isshin-san's place.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.860
I wonder why he waited until now to appear in front of me.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.410
Well, it will work out somehow.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.940
Don't run away!

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.370
A tragic traffic accident that occurred...

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:21.150
What are you going to do, Teppei?

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.490
I'll...

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:45.460
Milady, as long as I, Alfred, am still with you, you need not fear a thing.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:09.910
Take that!

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:14.030
What an impolite chap.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:16.170
But getting off this mountain will be...

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.090
Come out, you!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:27.510
Whoa!  This one's a winner.

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.180
Are you alright?

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:33.770
You are...

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.690
Kobayashi Teppei!

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:37.430
I didn't ask for your name!

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.110
Hang on!

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:39.750
I'll deal with them somehow!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.030
Right, Dad?

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.530
What's with this guy, does he think he's Mark Sullivan?

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.760
Have a good trip!

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.510
Take this!

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.630
Damn kid!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.540
Jiiya, that person is...

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:12.230
Milady!  It will get a little rough from here, please stay in the carriage!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.730
Here we go.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.530
Hey, get rid of that brat quick!

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.530
You bastard, I've had enough, go to hell!

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.160
Milady!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.220
Stop the damn...

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.200
Oops.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:34.950
Your show's over already.

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.080
I've had it with you.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:38.960
Worthless scum.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.050
Down with you!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.860
What the hell is this...?

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:52.810
Jiiya!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.100
Milady!

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:17.820
Jiiya!

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.430
Milady!

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:53.530
Whoa.  That's it for them.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:59.070
Don't let your guard down, old man.

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:02.330
I always thought I could protect Milady.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:05.880
After all this, I no longer have a reason to live.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.960
Then I'll hold your last rites.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:15.340
But I must not leave a debt unpaid.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:21.390
Those who lay hands on the Hazelrink family have committed a crime so deep that only death can repay!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.450
Ouch...

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.860
Was I saved because those acted like cushions?

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:49.030
There's a cushion here, too...

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:57.560
Hey, you woke up, that's great!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.390
Oh, good afternoon.

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:01.930
I wonder if it's too early to say good evening.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.010
Where is this?

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.650
Why am I in a place like this?

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.610
Don't tell me you don't remember anything?

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:13.030
I remember up until the point we were speeding down the mountain road.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.700
Ah!  What's my name, anyway?

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:17.410
No way!

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.350
I lied.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:20.380
Charlotte.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.960
Charlotte Hazelrink.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:24.290
Nice to meet you.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.960
Why would you make up a lie like that, anyway?

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.290
I'm Kobayashi Teppei.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.800
Charlotte Ha...zel...ri...nk?

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:35.090
That sounds like a princess's name.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:37.300
Yes!  Because I am one.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:40.140
Why <i>did</i> you make up a lie like that anyway?

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.680
Ah!  Sorry, I didn't realize.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.900
I'm not used to this stuff.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.850
And you're used to touching a sleeping girl's breasts?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.290
It's not what you think!

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.750
By accident!  Yeah, that was by accident...coincidence!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.060
Alright, I'll trust you, Teppei.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.210
Since you were the one who saved me, after all.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.300
What...you do remember after all!

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.210
How did my breasts feel?

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:20.230
I have no idea what feel you're talking about...

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:25.060
Speaking of which, do men really like girls with big breasts?

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.940
Well...um...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.690
It depends on the individual, I think.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:36.100
Is your bike broken?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.570
No, it's actually in better condition than I thought.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:39.890
What a relief.

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.280
Milady!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:45.910
I have to go now.

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:48.750
I get scolded if I'm together with an unknown guy.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.080
I see.  That's pretty scary.

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:53.880
But even so, using a horse-drawn carriage is...

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.630
Thank you, Teppei!

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:21.490
Oh damn, I need to bring my luggage to the house!

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.510
Still no one?

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:41.120
Yes.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:45.220
Making Arima Isshin wait, eh?

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:49.500
As expected of my daughter's son.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:54.610
I told you, I was called here by Arima Isshin.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:56.860
That's pretty big.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:59.620
That thing on your back.  That's a katana, right?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.110
Please call the police.  This is a violation of Swords and Firearms Control.

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:03.820
Yes sir!

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.240
Huh!?  W-Wait a minute!

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:07.150
You stay here!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:09.730
Listen to me!

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:10.810
Hold it!

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:15.480
That person is my guest of honor.

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:18.170
Entertain him as grandly as you can.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:21.130
I...Isshin-sama's guest...

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:24.620
H...Hey!  Get a hold of yourself!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.180
Teppei.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:27.680
Come with me.

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:32.430
I'm sorry, Isshin-san. I'm late.

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:37.570
Won't you call me Grandpa?

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:40.690
It feels a bit sudden.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.280
How does 'Grandfather' sound?

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.430
Well, that is fine.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.130
Grandfather.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.720
I'd like to ask you again.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:50.130
Say it.

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:52.290
It's true, isn't it?

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.280
Dad and Mom weren't in an accident.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.690
What will you do when you find the culprit?

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:06.220
I will avenge them.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:08.430
And then what?

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:12.130
You will end up being the next to receive revenge.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:18.020
Do you really want to live in that endless chain of suffering and sadness?

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:21.880
Is that the dying wish of Kanae and that man to you?

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.100
Aren't you sad that your own daughter died?!

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:26.380
Hmm.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:28.710
I have you now.

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:30.620
I have no one but you.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.720
Um, you will be dining.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.710
If you go in like that, you will startle the guests.

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.340
Oh yes, you came late.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:44.580
What did you do to end up late?

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:45.930
I was rescuing someone.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:47.990
You rescued someone?!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.480
Alright!  Go in like that!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:57.630
You have gotten dirty doing the right thing.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:59.390
There is nothing to hide!

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.180
Is this really okay?

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:21.410
My guests, those who continue to support the Arima Group,

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:26.950
Torishimiya and Onmyougi, officials, ladies and gentlemen, I apologize for the wait.

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.790
Allow me to introduce to you

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:32.840
my <i>son</i>, Arima Teppei,

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.390
and the successor to the leadership of the Arima Group.

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.100
Huh!?  Successor?!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:44.150
You may be surprised at his untidiness,

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:48.440
but before he came here, he was on a rescue.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.280
Oh yes, who did you rescue?

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.990
Someone named Charlotte Hazelrink.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:02.430
I see!  Her Highness, the daughter of Hazelrink, eh?

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.410
This person is way too much.

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:06.020
Her Highness...?

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:08.600
The Hazelrink Principality!?

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.760
She's <i>really a princess?!</i>

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.990
Ah, I'm happy that there's so much excitement.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:15.000
Thus, even so, with regards to his current outfit that you all see,

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.100
I'd like to apologize for his appearance.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:19.570
Please spare him some time to refresh himself.

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:21.980
In the meantime, please enjoy yourselves.

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.760
Whats with this leadership succession nonsense?!

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:31.620
I only accepted the adoption because I can seek revenge!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:33.580
Then seek it.

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:38.780
There are people who don't find you becoming successor amusing.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:43.170
I wanted to know who they were, so I made up that joke.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:44.630
What do you mean?

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.990
Did you not know?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.430
Kanae was the real successor.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:53.160
The real successor...

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.180
...so...?

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.180
The enemy will appear in good time.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:58.930
You must make allies first.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.770
Don't worry about what happened.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.240
Be friends with those who are close to you first.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:11.740
Teppei-kun, as expected, you look like your father.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:16.080
Allow me to introduce myself, too.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:18.330
I'm Todomura from The Arima Group Commissions Department!

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:19.650
Good to meet you.

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.330
Y-You too.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:24.940
Somewhere here...

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:25.970
Excuse me.

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:29.130
There are so many adults here.  No need to crowd around in one place.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:30.320
He's getting frightened.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.050
Sir Hossen!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:33.330
Sir Hossen?

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:38.140
As Arima-dono's personal escort, I ask if there's anything you'd like to talk about?

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:41.490
Oh, nothing that would interest you, Sir Hossen.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:45.580
How unsightly of them, eh?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:49.610
Everyone comes to you and hopes that Isshin will die quickly.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.130
I haven't introduced myself, have I?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.090
I'm Vincent van Hossen.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:55.120
Nice to meet you.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.080
Would you like me to introduce my daughters to you?

00:17:58.780 --> 00:17:59.530
Sure.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:05.790
Papa, is this the young man that became Uncle's kid?

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.800
You don't call him Uncle!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:11.130
I'm sorry, she's grown so much but she still doesn't know her manners.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:12.520
It's okay.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.580
Hello.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.570
My name is Maria van Hossen.

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:20.800
I'm Arima Teppei.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.580
Nice to meet you.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:23.990
You look so tense.

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.940
Heh, really?

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:28.050
Where's Silvie?

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.360
Big sister has gone somewhere.

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:32.650
Eeeh?!  How hopeless.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.990
I'm sorry Teppei-kun, today...

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:39.990
When Isshin-san arrives, the atmosphere completely changes.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:41.660
He's got amazing charisma.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:42.540
You're right.

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:44.400
We feel the same way about you, too.

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:45.000
Eh?

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:46.980
Well, you should be feeling more used to this now.

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:48.790
I'll move along now.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.300
See you later, Onii-chan!

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:53.860
Teppei-sama, may I?

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:56.760
Ah, wait, hold it!

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:00.820
No way, I don't get these people.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:03.210
Just talking to them takes all I've got!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.260
Ah, Thank you.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.390
You were really nice just now.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.770
Well, I am a maid.

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.040
A maid?  Really?

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:13.790
What else do you see me as?

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:18.030
Well, it's true that I don't see anything else but a maid...

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.370
A real maid, huh...?

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.640
Teppei-sama, where are you going?

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:43.390
At times when you don't know what to do, it's best to move your body!

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.380
That's awesome.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:16.330
I always wanted to spar with Western fencers!

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:17.180
You despicable man.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.760
Stop it right there!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.190
Father!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:02.840
Huh?

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.880
They are a perfect match, aren't they?

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:07.290
Perfect match?

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:11.980
Onii-chan is as strong as Onee-chan, isn't he?

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:15.350
It's a bit early to be calling him Onii-chan, Maria.

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:17.910
You've saved me quite a bit of trouble, Teppei.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:25.370
You should know each other now that you've sparred, Teppei.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:29.230
She is Sylvia van Hossen.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:31.500
She is your fiancee.

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:33.960
Eh?  Fiancee?!

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:27.870
Question!

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:28.580
What?

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:31.740
